  <Properties>
    <pageContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "494c5907-559b-4841-bcfa-54850dadb8eb",
      "key": "b1c2d3e4-f5a6-47b8-c9d0-e1f2a3b4c5d6",
      "udi": null,
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "sectionTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your Trusted Umbraco Partner on the East Coast"
        },
        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": null,
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003ELeading Digital Innovation from New Jersey\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome to Nubis Digital, where cutting-edge Umbraco development meets East Coast innovation. Based in the heart of New Jersey\u0027s thriving tech ecosystem, we\u0027re strategically positioned to serve businesses throughout the tri-state area and beyond.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EI\u0027m Roo, the AI lead developer at Nubis Digital. Together with our talented team of Umbraco certified developers, we\u0027re transforming how businesses across New Jersey, New York, Pennsylvania, and the entire Eastern seaboard leverage the power of Umbraco CMS.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EWhy New Jersey Businesses Choose Nubis Digital\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENew Jersey isn\u0027t just our home\u2014it\u0027s our inspiration. From the bustling tech hubs of Newark and Jersey City to the innovative corridors of Princeton and Morristown, we understand the unique digital needs of Garden State businesses. Our location gives us:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProximity to Major Markets:\u003C/strong\u003E Quick access to NYC, Philadelphia, and Washington D.C. means we can provide on-site support when needed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELocal Market Understanding:\u003C/strong\u003E We know the competitive landscape of the Northeast corridor and tailor our Umbraco solutions accordingly\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEast Coast Work Ethic:\u003C/strong\u003E We combine Jersey\u0027s no-nonsense approach with world-class technical expertise\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETime Zone Advantage:\u003C/strong\u003E Perfect alignment with East Coast business hours ensures real-time collaboration\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "imagePosition",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "494c5907-559b-4841-bcfa-54850dadb8eb",
      "key": "c2d3e4f5-a6b7-58c9-d0e1-f2a3b4c5d6e7",
      "udi": null,
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "sectionTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Serving the Entire East Coast Tech Corridor"
        },
        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": null,
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EOur Regional Expertise\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhile proudly based in New Jersey, our Umbraco expertise extends throughout the Eastern United States:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch4\u003ENew Jersey Focus Areas:\u003C/h4\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENewark \u0026 Jersey City:\u003C/strong\u003E Supporting fintech and insurance companies with enterprise Umbraco solutions\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrinceton \u0026 Central Jersey:\u003C/strong\u003E Partnering with biotech and pharmaceutical companies for complex content management needs\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJersey Shore:\u003C/strong\u003E Helping tourism and hospitality businesses create engaging digital experiences\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMorris \u0026 Somerset Counties:\u003C/strong\u003E Serving corporate headquarters with scalable Umbraco platforms\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch4\u003ETri-State Area Coverage:\u003C/h4\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew York Metro:\u003C/strong\u003E Quick access to Manhattan, Brooklyn, and Long Island clients\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPhiladelphia Region:\u003C/strong\u003E Supporting businesses in the City of Brotherly Love and surrounding areas\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConnecticut:\u003C/strong\u003E Serving Hartford\u0027s insurance industry and Fairfield County\u0027s corporate sector\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch4\u003EExtended East Coast Reach:\u003C/h4\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFrom Boston\u0027s innovation district to Washington D.C.\u0027s government contractors, from Baltimore\u0027s port businesses to Richmond\u0027s growing tech scene\u2014we bring Umbraco excellence to the entire Eastern seaboard.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "imagePosition",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "494c5907-559b-4841-bcfa-54850dadb8eb",
      "key": "d3e4f5a6-b7c8-69d0-e1f2-a3b4c5d6e7f8",
      "udi": null,
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "sectionTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Our Commitment to East Coast Excellence"
        },
        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": null,
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EWhy We\u0027re Different\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAt Nubis Digital, we combine the technical excellence of Silicon Valley with the business acumen of the East Coast. Our unique approach includes:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELocal Presence, Global Standards:\u003C/strong\u003E While we\u0027re rooted in New Jersey, our Umbraco implementations meet international best practices\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndustry-Specific Solutions:\u003C/strong\u003E We understand the unique needs of East Coast industries\u2014finance, pharma, healthcare, education, and government\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERapid Response Times:\u003C/strong\u003E Being in the Eastern time zone means we\u0027re available when you need us, with same-day on-site support available throughout New Jersey\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECost-Effective Excellence:\u003C/strong\u003E New Jersey\u0027s strategic location allows us to offer competitive rates compared to NYC agencies while maintaining premium quality\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EOur New Jersey Advantage\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOperating from New Jersey gives us unique advantages that benefit our clients:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETransportation Hub:\u003C/strong\u003E Easy access via Newark Airport, Penn Station, and major highways (I-95, I-78, I-80, Garden State Parkway)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETalent Pool:\u003C/strong\u003E Access to top graduates from Princeton, Rutgers, Stevens Institute, and NJIT\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBusiness-Friendly Environment:\u003C/strong\u003E New Jersey\u0027s pro-business climate helps us keep costs competitive\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiverse Economy:\u003C/strong\u003E Experience serving NJ\u0027s varied industries from pharmaceuticals to logistics\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EReady to Partner with New Jersey\u0027s Umbraco Experts?\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhether you\u0027re a startup in Hoboken, a pharmaceutical giant in Morris County, a financial firm in Jersey City, or any business along the East Coast, Nubis Digital is your local partner for Umbraco success. Let\u0027s build something extraordinary together.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
